  "source": {
    "label": "Artificial Analysis open-model index (family discovery)",
    "url": "https://artificialanalysis.ai/models/open-source",
    "methodology": "Official model cards provide architecture, parameter, context and license fields. The Artificial Analysis public model index was used only to identify representative mainstream open-weight families; hosted-provider intelligence, price, TPS and latency metrics are not imported as local-hardware evidence. Fit is derived from model weights plus configured KV-cache, runtime and safety overhead and must be validated with the intended runtime and checkpoint. Architecture-derived fields (context window, KV-cache bytes per token) are refreshed on a weekly schedule from each model's published Hugging Face config.json. Parameter counts, capability tier, license and commercial-use terms remain human-curated in pipeline/models.seed.yaml.",
    "license": "Mixed: Apache 2.0, MIT, Llama Community licenses and other model-specific terms"
  },
